        "text_block_ccneqT": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/099A1204-2.jpg",
            "title": "Flat-out Comfort: A Sleek Design to Stretch Out In",
            "text": "<p>Both bed designs feature a sleek, versatile look that seamlessly blends with your home interiors. The Plush Flat Bed offers added versatility with its subtle, minimalist design. It fits comfortably inside the Koozi Side Table Crate or other standard crates, making it easy to integrate into any room while providing a cozy spot for your pet.</p>",
