        "text_block_VLTqVg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/KOOZI-STUDIO-43.jpg",
            "title": "Ultra-Soft Memory Foam with Cooling Gel",
            "text": "<p>The mattress in both the Cloud Bed and Plush Flat Bed features a luxurious blend of premium, CertiPUR-US® certified supportive foam and a cooling gel memory foam layer, offering better breathability and cloud softness. This thoughtful design ensures your dog receives optimal support for their joints and body while remaining plush and enjoyable, especially for small to medium dogs.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
