    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the right size for my dog?",
            "text": "<p>We recommend referring to our size guide at the top of the page, to ensure you choose the right size for your dog. </p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I assemble the crate?",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi Crate Side Table arrives flat-packed and can be assembled in under 15 minutes with our clear instructions. <br/><br/>For additional assistance, please refer to our assembly videos.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the benefits of crate training?",
            "text": "<p>Crate training can help dogs feel secure and comfortable by providing a personal, safe space that reduces anxiety and fosters a sense of routine, especially overnight. This practice is particularly beneficial during a puppy's early months and years, supporting their learning and growth, but it also serves as a practical and cherished retreat for dogs of all ages. The Koozi Side Table Crate continues to serve as a dedicated safe den for sleep and relaxation throughout your dog's life.</p><p>With the Koozi Side Table Crate, you can offer this essential comfort without the eyesore of traditional crates. Instead, it serves as a stylish statement piece that enhances your home decor.</p><p>Recognising that crate training is a personal choice that varies based on your dog's needs, our crate features a hidden pocket door system. This innovative design allows it to function as both a cosy den with the door up and a chic side table for your living space.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and returns",
            "text": "<h6>Warranty Coverage</h6><p>Koozi Pets provides a <strong>12-month limited warranty</strong> covering manufacturing defects only. This warranty applies solely to defects from faulty workmanship.<br/><br/>The warranty period for Crates purchased from Koozi is one (1) year from the date of purchase. If a replacement Crate or part is provided, it will inherit the remaining warranty of the original item or one year from the replacement date.</p><p>During the warranty period, Koozi Pets will replace any products or parts of the crate that are proven to be defective due to improper material or workmanship, only. Repairs and/or replacements are provided at no charge to you, for eligible warranty claims.<br/><br/>The warranty does <strong>not</strong> cover:</p><ul><li><strong>Damage caused by improper assembly </strong>or not following the instructions when unpacking.</li><li><strong>Normal wear and tear</strong>, including any dog-related use, washing-related wear, weathering, sun-damage or corrosion.</li><li><strong>Damages due to use by pets</strong> (e.g., chewing, bites, rips, burns, excessive scratching, stains, or moisture/liquid damage).</li><li><strong>Damage from improper weight placement</strong> on the crate.</li><li><strong>Scars, marks and colour</strong> that are characteristics of natural materials;</li><li><strong>Damage caused by spills </strong>such as acid, solvents, dyes or other corrosive materials, ink, paint, or bodily fluids</li><li><strong>Commercial use</strong> damage, such as use in hotels or stores.</li></ul><p><br/>To make a claim please read our policy and steps to submit a claim <a href=\"https://koozipets.com.au/pages/warranty-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty & Returns\">here</a>.</p><h6>Returns and Exchanges Policy</h6><p><strong>We do not offer returns or exchanges</strong> on the Side Table Crate, including for change of mind, as it is a<em> large furniture item</em> and cannot be returned once shipped to you. There is no way of you shipping it back to us.<br/><br/>Before purchasing, please ensure the crate meets your dog’s size and has that you have an adequate space in your home to fit it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_9hdUQn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes the Koozi Side Table Crate different to other crates?",
            "text": "<p><strong>Dual Functionality</strong>: Unlike standard crates, the Koozi Side Table Crate serves a dual purpose as a stylish side table and a functional dog den. This allows it to seamlessly blend into your home decor while providing a cosy, safe space for your pet.</p><p><strong>Design Aesthetic</strong>: The Koozi Side Table Crate is designed to be visually appealing, ensuring that it complements your interior design rather than detracting from i, unlike the eyesore of wire crates. This modern approach to pet furniture enhances the overall look of your shared living spaces.</p><p><strong>Versatile Use</strong>: With the option to leave the door open for a safe den or closed for crate training, it offers flexibility in how you use the crate, adapting to your dog's needs.</p><p><strong>Quality Furniture Materials</strong>: Crafted with premium materials, including a durable construction that’s built to last, the Koozi Side Table Crate is both functional and stylish, setting it apart from lower-quality metal alternatives.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_yjA4iA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order ship?",
            "text": "<p>We ship from our warehouse in South Granville, Sydney.<br/><br/>All orders will be dispatched within 1 to 2 business days.<br/><br/>Orders placed on Saturday or Sunday, will be processed the next business day.<br/><br/>Delivery time is typically between 3 - 10 days, depending on your location in Australia.<br/><br/>We offer the option to click and collect at check out. Pick up from our warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_iRM9zw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this suitable for new puppies?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, the Koozi Side Table Crate is perfect for introducing your puppy to a safe space, with a design that will last a lifetime and complement your home. While the melamine-coated wood is waterproof, we recommend placing a dedicated towel on the base of the crate, beneath the bed, during the toilet training phase for added protection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_CpK9RK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I ask for assistance?",
            "text": "<p>For further assistance, contact our Care team: help@koozipets.com.au</p>"
          }
